#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:2
msgid "Sphinx Markdown 语法参考"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:4
msgid "本附录收录了在这本书中常见的 Sphinx Markdown 语法，面向需要撰写教程内容的贡献者，而非学习者。如果你只想学习深度学习，可以跳过。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:7
msgid ""
"基本所有示例代码存放在 `examples/` 子目录中，通过 `literalinclude` 引用。这样做可以避免 MyST "
"指令在代码块内被误解析。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:10
msgid "嵌套指令"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:12
msgid "Markdown 不支持在代码块内再嵌套代码块，Sphinx 用 `~~~`（波浪线）作为内层分隔符："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{note}\n"
"   ~~~{note}\n"
"      ~~~{note}\n"
"        ~~~{important}\n"
"        Hello World!\n"
"        ~~~\n"
"      ~~~\n"
"   ~~~\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:18
msgid "换一种分隔符：`` ``` `` → `~~~`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:20
msgid "图表"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:22
msgid "Mermaid（流程图）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{mermaid}\n"
"---\n"
"caption: <标题文本, 可选>\n"
"align: center\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"graph LR\n"
"    A[方角] -->|连接文字| B(圆角)\n"
"    B --> C{判断}\n"
"    C -->|条件一| D[结果一]\n"
"    C -->|条件二| E[结果二]\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:29
msgid "Mermaid 适合用于展示简单的图表，如流程图、序列图等（或者你不想调试 TikZ 代码）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:31
msgid "Mermaid 图表语法参考：[https://mermaid.js.org/](https://mermaid.js.org/)。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:33
msgid ""
"正确渲染需要 Chrome 系浏览器 （如 Chrome/Chromium、Edge 等）和 mermaid-cli (mmdc) "
"工具，安装方法如下："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:35
msgid "npm install -g @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli  # Linux 可能需要 sudo\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:40
msgid "TikZ（复杂图表）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{tikz} 图标题\n"
"\\begin{tikzpicture}\n"
"    \\draw (0,0) -- (1,1) -- (2,0) -- (0,0);\n"
"\\end{tikzpicture}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:47
msgid "TikZ 适合用于展示复杂的图表，如网络架构等。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:49
msgid "需要 TeXLive + pdf2svg 才能渲染。缺少依赖时文档仍可编译，只是图表不显示。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:52
msgid "图片"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{figure} /path/to/image.png\n"
"---\n"
"width: 400px\n"
"align: center\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"图片说明文字。\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:58
msgid "路径相对于 Markdown 文件所在位置。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:62
msgid "不推荐设定 width 为 100%，因为这会导致图片在不同设备上显示不一致。 图片宽度建议设置为 400-600 px，根据需要调整。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:66
msgid "代码"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:68
msgid "大段代码推荐放在单独文件中，用 `literalinclude` 引用："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{literalinclude} /path/to/code.py\n"
":language: python\n"
":linenos:\n"
":caption: 代码标题\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:78
msgid "这是本指南本身使用的技巧——用 `literalinclude` 展示代码示例，避免 MyST 解析冲突。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:80
msgid "`linenos` 启用行号。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:82
msgid "数学公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:84
msgid "行内公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:86
msgid "质能方程：$E = mc^2$\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:91
msgid "行间公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"E = mc^2\n"
"$$\n"
"\n"
"或\n"
"\n"
"```{math}\n"
"E = mc^2\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:98
msgid "彩色提示框"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{admonition} 标题（可选）\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"这是提示内容。\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:104
msgid ""
"可用 "
"class：`attention`、`caution`、`danger`、`error`、`hint`、`important`、`note`、`tip`、`warning`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:106
msgid "目录树"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:108
msgid "在 admonition 内嵌套 toctree（用 `~~~` 分隔）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"## 目录\n"
"\n"
"```{toctree}\n"
":maxdepth: 1\n"
"\n"
"lesson2/index\n"
"lesson4/index\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:114
msgid "每行是 `.md` 文件路径（不含 `.md` 扩展名）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:116
msgid "Cross-Reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:118
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{ref}` — 引用章节/标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:120
msgid "**定义标签**（放在标题上方）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:122
msgid ""
"(my-label)=\n"
"## 目标章节\n"
"\n"
"内容...\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:126
msgid "**引用标签**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:128
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"详见 {ref}`my-label`。\n"
"\n"
"或自定义链接文字：{ref}`这是链接文字 <my-label>`。\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:132
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{doc}` — 引用整个文档"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid "下一节 {doc}`./folder/filename`。\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:138
msgid "不含 `.md` 扩展名。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:140
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{cite}` — 引用文献"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:142
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{cite}`citation-key`\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:146
msgid "最佳实践"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:148
msgid "标签用描述性名称：`(gradient-vanishing)=` 而非 `(section-5)=`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:149
msgid "文件顶部定义标签：`(label)=` 紧邻 `# 标题` 之上"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:150
#, python-brace-format
msgid "用 `{ref}` 引用章节/概念，用 `{doc}` 引用整篇文档"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:151
msgid "重命名文件后更新所有 cross-reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:153
msgid "文献管理（BibTeX）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:155
msgid "所有引用存放在 `source/references.bib` 中，格式为 BibTeX。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:157
msgid "**添加一条引用**：在 `references.bib` 末尾追加，key 命名规则为 `作者姓氏年份关键词`："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:159
msgid ""
"@inproceedings{vaswani2017attention,\n"
"  title={Attention is all you need},\n"
"  author={Vaswani, Ashish and ...},\n"
"  booktitle={Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems},\n"
"  volume={30},\n"
"  year={2017}\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:169
msgid "**在正文中引用**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{cite}`vaswani2017attention`\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:175
msgid "**在文件末尾渲染参考文献列表**（只显示该文件实际引用的条目，仅引用了 `references.bib` 中的条目时需要添加）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:177
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"## 参考文献\n"
"\n"
"```{bibliography}\n"
":filter: docname in docnames\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:186
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`:filter: docname in docnames` 确保只列出本文档中通过 `{cite}` 实际引用过的条目，而非整个 "
"`references.bib`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:189
msgid "表格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:191
#, python-brace-format
msgid "使用 `{list-table}` 指令，支持多级表头："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:193
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{list-table} 表格标题\n"
":header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"* - 列一\n"
"  - 列二\n"
"  - 列三\n"
"* - 数据1\n"
"  - 数据2\n"
"  - 数据3\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:206
msgid "第一行（`* -`）为表头，后续行为数据。仅在 Markdown 表格不满足需求时使用（如需要 directive 嵌入或更复杂的格式）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:208
msgid "主目录树"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:210
#, python-brace-format
msgid "每个章节的 `index.md` 头部应有隐藏的 `{toctree}` 定义子文档顺序："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:212
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{toctree}\n"
":maxdepth: 2\n"
":hidden:\n"
"\n"
"introduction\n"
"cnn-basics\n"
"le-net\n"
"...\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:224
msgid "而在主 `source/index.md` 中定义全书的顶层目录树。条目为文件路径（不含 `.md` 扩展名）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:226
msgid "脚注"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:228
msgid "使用标准 Markdown 脚注语法："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:230
msgid ""
"一些文字[^note-key]。\n"
"\n"
"[^note-key]: 这是脚注内容。\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:236
msgid "脚注适合补充细节或提供扩展阅读链接，避免正文冗长。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:238
msgid "条件渲染"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:240
msgid "条件渲染使得一部分内容仅在满足条件时渲染。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:242
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{only} html\n"
"只在 HTML 输出中渲染的内容。\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:248
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{only} html or epub\n"
"只在 HTML 或 EPUB 输出中渲染的内容。\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:254
msgid "或者"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"```{only} not latex\n"
"只在非 PDF 输出中渲染的内容。\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:262
msgid "注意"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/sphinx-guide/index.md:265
msgid ""
"为了兼容 Sphinx 的 LaTeX 输出，index 除了隐藏的 ToC，其他内容都必须通过此方法取消渲染。 "
"其余页面需要取消参考文献列表的渲染。"
msgstr ""

